  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n12 - 8 ÷ 2 - {16 of (-2) + (3 × 5 - 4)}\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n12 – 8 ÷ 2 – {16 of (–2) + (3 × 5 – 4)}\n\n⇒ 12 – 8 ÷ 2 – {–32 + (15 – 4)}\n\n⇒ 12 – 8 ÷ 2 – {–32 + 11}\n\n⇒ 12 – 8 ÷ 2 – {–21}\n\n⇒ 12 – 8 ÷ 2 + 21\n\n⇒ 12 – 4 + 21 = 29\n\n**∴ The value of 12 - 8 ÷ 2 -{16 of (-2) + (3 × 5 - 4)} is 29.**",
